    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks, that makes sense. so it's really about those Form V crystals. can you walk me through a specific temperature curve for a 70% dark chocolate? like, what are the exact degrees for the melting, cooling, and reheating phases so i can be sure i'm getting that stable bloom-free finish?",
